        {
          "$type": "Models.PMF.Plant, Models",
          "PlantType": "Pinus",
          "Name": "Pinus",
          "ResourceName": null,
          "Children": [
            {
              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
              "Text": "Although Pinus trees have needles as their foliage, they are the Leaf component of the model to conform to PMF needs. Although the reproductive component of the model (called Cone here) is of minor interest for wood production, it can make up several percent of tree wieght and for which we found some data to guide calibration. Phenology is simple in this model and could become a focus for future model develompent, e.g. for tree breeding or pollen production. Allometric relationships for height (Ht, m), stem diameter (DBH, cm, over bark at 1.3 m height), and their derivatives (stem volume Vol m3/ha, and mean annual increment MAI m3/ha/year) were developed as a function of above-ground biomass based on observations. Root:shoot ratio is an emergent property of the model based on separate calibrations for root and shoot mass. Wood density remains pooly calibrated as few observations of whole tree wood density are available and based on stem analysis. So here wood density is an emergent proporty of the model, and observed versus predicted graphs of it  are included only as a general check that both wood volume and wood weight are correctly simulated.    \n\n\n",
              "Name": "Memo",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Functions.AccumulateFunction, Models",
              "StartStageName": "Emergence",
              "EndStageName": "Old",
              "ResetStageName": null,
              "FractionRemovedOnCut": 0.0,
              "FractionRemovedOnHarvest": 0.0,
              "FractionRemovedOnGraze": 0.0,
              "FractionRemovedOnPrune": 0.0,
              "Name": "Age",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 0.002737909,
                  "Units": "years",
                  "Name": "day",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "This converts days of growth to age in years.\r\n\r\n",
                      "Name": "Memo",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                }
              ],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
              "FixedValue": 0.0,
              "Units": null,
              "Name": "MortalityRate",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "Kept at zero: this generic plant mortality reduces stem numbers without removing biomass. Pinus mortality is in StemMortality (applied through the TreeThinning script).",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                }
              ],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Functions.ExpressionFunction, Models",
              "Units": "/y",
              "Expression": "[StemMortality].Background + [StemMortality].RateAtMaximum * max(0, ([Pinus].Stem.SizeClass.StandDensityIndex / [StemMortality].MaximumSDI - [StemMortality].Onset) / (1 - [StemMortality].Onset))",
              "Name": "StemMortality",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "Annual stem mortality, applied monthly by the TreeThinning script through the stem size distribution (smallest trees first, with the thinning-from-below selectivity), so dead trees' leaves and branches go to litter and the DBH distribution stays consistent. Stands are also never allowed above MaximumSDI. Structure follows the self-thinning literature: background mortality plus competition mortality starting at Onset x MaximumSDI (Reineke stand density index, stems/ha at 25.4 cm quadratic mean DBH; Long 1985; Williams 1994; Mason 2023 NZ radiata) and rising linearly to RateAtMaximum at MaximumSDI. Calibrated on 241 inter-measurement intervals from the validation sites with real stocking records (background 0.38%/yr and 1.5%/yr at the maximum fitted as well as an unconstrained fit). MaximumSDI: radiata 1600 (published indirect values 1500-2200, Mason 2023, Vanclay & Sands 2009; validation radiata stands peak at 1020-1230 on mostly dry sites); southern pines 1100 (loblolly 900-1250, Zhao et al. 2020, VanderSchaaf 2006; set in the taeda, elliottii, caribaea and hybrid cultivars; unverified for slash, Caribbean and hybrids). Background mortality published at 0.5-1%/yr (loblolly 0.8%/yr, Zeide & Zhang 2006).",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 0.004,
                  "Units": "/y",
                  "Name": "Background",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 0.015,
                  "Units": "/y",
                  "Name": "RateAtMaximum",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 1600.0,
                  "Units": "/ha",
                  "Name": "MaximumSDI",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 0.55,
                  "Units": "0-1",
                  "Name": "Onset",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                }
              ],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Functions.ExpressionFunction, Models",
              "Units": "/y",
              "Expression": "[DroughtMortality].MaximumRate / (1 + exp([DroughtMortality].Steepness * ([DroughtMortality].HalfRateDrop - [TreeThinning].Script.WaterUseDrop))) * min(1, ([Pinus].Stem.SizeClass.StandDensityIndex / ([StemMortality].MaximumSDI * [StemMortality].Onset))^2)",
              "Name": "DroughtMortality",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "DORMANT (MaximumRate = 0): drought-induced mortality, kept ready to switch on but not calibrated. To activate set MaximumRate (literature-based starting value 0.15 /y). Drought is treated as relative: pines grow well on dry sites, but a stand whose canopy, sapwood and roots were built on more water than is now available cannot shed them fast enough (structural overshoot, Jump et al. 2017). The extra water can come from wetter years (McGrath et al. 2001 WA, deaths after two dry winters; BFG F 1985-87 after wet 1983-84) or from a bank of stored soil water that runs out (first-rotation E. globulus grew well for 5-8 years on stored water, then died once it was exhausted, while slower second-rotation stands without the bank did not; White and Mendham). WaterUseDrop (TreeThinning script, reported as [TreeThinning].Script.WaterUseDrop) = max(0, 1 - recent / reference running mean of FineRoot water uptake), recent over RecentPeriod days and reference over ReferencePeriod days (the water use the canopy was built on). Uptake covers rain, irrigation and stored soil water, so it sees both a rainfall drop and an exhausted soil-water bank; rainfall alone misses the bank, and the water stress factor Fw has no memory because the model canopy adjusts to water within months. The index is only as good as the simulated soil water: rooting depth and PAWC must be right (Marano et al.). Annual rate = MaximumRate / (1 + exp(Steepness x (HalfRateDrop - WaterUseDrop))) x min(1, (SDI / (MaximumSDI x Onset))^2): steep logistic (Hammond et al. 2019) amplified by stand density (McGrath basal-area threshold; Stone et al. 2012 NSW, unthinned stands 9-15x more deaths), applied monthly after competition mortality with weak small-tree selectivity (Selectivity, vs 1.83 for self-thinning; McGrath suppressed trees died at about twice the rate of dominants). Typical magnitudes: most events kill 1-5% of trees, about 10% of affected area over 15% (Carnegie et al. 2022). Indicative index values in the validation runs (365 d vs 1825 d): BFG 1985-88 C 0.09, F 0.10, irrigated 0; site maxima 0.13-0.27. HalfRateDrop 0.35 and Steepness 20 are placeholders. Not calibrated: the only drought-mortality case in the validation data is one plot (BFG F, 13.7% of stems 1984-88 vs C 2.7%), and no model water index separates it from C; calibrate against radiata drought-mortality plot data (e.g. McGrath WA 1986-88, with rainfall and soil depth) before use. Prototypes 2026-11-13: duration of low Fw stayed inactive even under a 50% rain cut; a rainfall-only drop index (recent vs 5-yr rain) at MaximumRate 0.15 killed 4-13% at sites with no recorded drought deaths (FSA, FPQ, HQP321R1).",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 0.0,
                  "Units": "/y",
                  "Name": "MaximumRate",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 0.35,
                  "Units": "0-1",
                  "Name": "HalfRateDrop",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 20.0,
                  "Units": null,
                  "Name": "Steepness",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 365.0,
                  "Units": "d",
                  "Name": "RecentPeriod",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 1825.0,
                  "Units": "d",
                  "Name": "ReferencePeriod",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 0.5,
                  "Units": null,
                  "Name": "Selectivity",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                }
              ],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
              "FixedValue": 0.0,
              "Units": null,
              "Name": "SeedMortalityRate",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
            {
              "$type": "Models.PMF.Phen.Phenology, Models",
              "Name": "Phenology",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "Phenology is currently very simplistic in the Pinus model.    \n\n\n",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.StageBasedInterpolation, Models",
                  "Values": null,
                  "Proportional": true,
                  "Name": "StageCode",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                  "FixedValue": 1.0,
                  "Units": "^od",
                  "Name": "ThermalTime",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.PMF.Phen.GerminatingPhase, Models",
                  "Start": "Sowing",
                  "End": "Germination",
                  "IsEmerged": false,
                  "Name": "Germinating",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "We make no distinction between sowing and transplanting in this model, but all sites used transplants not sown seeds. Initial weights are specified for Leaf (1 g/plant) and fine root (0.2 g/plant), which implies these are transplants. Germinating and emerging phenology phases are included in case they are needed by later users. No planting shock is included, but this could be considered in future versions, e.g. delay in commencement of root downward growth. \r\n \r\n",
                      "Name": "Memo",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    },
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                      "FixedValue": 0.0,
                      "Units": null,
                      "Name": "MinSoilTemperature",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.PMF.Phen.EmergingPhase, Models",
                  "Start": "Germination",
                  "End": "Emergence",
                  "IsEmerged": false,
                  "TTForTimeStep": 0.0,
                  "Name": "Emerging",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Functions.VariableReference, Models",
                      "VariableName": "[Phenology].ThermalTime",
                      "Name": "ThermalTime",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    },
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Functions.AddFunction, Models",
                      "Name": "Target",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                          "FixedValue": 1.0,
                          "Units": null,
                          "Name": "ShootLag",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        },
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Functions.MultiplyFunction, Models",
                          "Name": "DepthxRate",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Functions.VariableReference, Models",
                              "VariableName": "[Plant].SowingData.Depth",
                              "Name": "SowingDepth",
                              "ResourceName": null,
                              "Children": [],
                              "Enabled": true,
                              "ReadOnly": false
                            },
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                              "FixedValue": 0.0,
                              "Units": null,
                              "Name": "ShootRate",
                              "ResourceName": null,
                              "Children": [],
                              "Enabled": true,
                              "ReadOnly": false
