                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Functions.MultiplyFunction, Models",
                  "Name": "LeafResidenceTime",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Functions.LinearInterpolationFunction, Models",
                      "Name": "HeightBased",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                          "Text": "Needle residence time (d) as a function of mean tree height (m), not Age (2026-11-14). Radiata breakpoints 0.3, 1, 2, 4, 6, 9.5, 16, 25 m are the median simulated radiata heights at the former ages 0, 1, 2, 3, 6, 9, 15, 25 y; values mainly from Cremer 1992 and Beets & Pollock 1987. Southern pines set their own Y (350-650 d) and X (taeda 0.3, 0.85, 1.7, 2.6, 4, 6, 12, 25.5 m; caribaea, hybrids and slash 0.3, 1.2, 4.5, 7, 12, 16, 21, 25 m, from their simulated heights at the same ages) in the cultivars. Lower or higher radiata breakpoints were tested and fitted LAI slightly worse.",
                          "Name": "Memo",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        },
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Functions.XYPairs, Models",
                          "X": [
                            0.3,
                            1.0,
                            2.0,
                            4.0,
                            6.0,
                            9.5,
                            16.0,
                            25.0
                          ],
                          "Y": [
                            350.0,
                            400.0,
                            500.0,
                            650.0,
                            1000.0,
                            1400.0,
                            1500.0,
                            1300.0
                          ],
                          "Name": "XYPairs",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        },
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Functions.VariableReference, Models",
                          "VariableName": "[Pinus].Stem.Ht",
                          "Name": "XValue",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        }
                      ],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    },
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Functions.ExpressionFunction, Models",
                      "Units": "0-1",
                      "Expression": "max(0.3, [Leaf].FLAI)",
                      "Name": "CanopyLimit",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    },
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "Leaf residence time in days (d)",
                      "Name": "Memo",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    },
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Functions.ExpressionFunction, Models",
                      "Units": null,
                      "Expression": "max(0.3, 1 - [Pinus].Leaf.LeafResidenceTime.DroughtEffect.Sensitivity * (1 - [TreeThinning].Script.SeasonalFw))",
                      "Name": "DroughtEffect",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                          "Text": "DORMANT (Sensitivity = 0): seasonal drought shortens needle retention. Residence time is multiplied by max(0.3, 1 - Sensitivity x (1 - SeasonalFw)), where SeasonalFw is a running mean (TimeConstant days) of Leaf.Fw kept in the TreeThinning script ([TreeThinning].Script.SeasonalFw). Because PerennialLeaf senesces every cohort older than the current residence time each day, a dry season sheds the oldest needle cohorts. Basis: John McGrath (pers. comm. 2026-11) - radiata needles in WA (Mediterranean summer drought) rarely last beyond 2 seasons, versus 3-4 seasons in eastern Australia. Prototype 2026-11-14 (radiata only, base residence times scaled up to compensate): Sensitivity 0.2-0.5 narrowed the BFG irrigated vs rainfed LAI contrast in the right direction (irrigated I bias -7.7% -> -3.8%, ILP -13.5% -> -10.5%), but cut growth at the dry radiata sites where volume is already under-predicted (FSA703A -12.5% -> -19%, Tower Hill Volub -2% -> -7.5%), mean NSE 0.839 -> 0.830. Applying it to southern pines (with scaled residence times) inflated IMPAC LAI (+25% -> +55%). To activate: set Sensitivity (~0.2-0.3) and lengthen HeightBased residence times (~x1.15-1.25) for radiata; test against WA needle retention data (McGrath) and re-tune dry-site productivity.",
                          "Name": "Memo",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        },
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                          "FixedValue": 0.0,
                          "Units": null,
                          "Name": "Sensitivity",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        },
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Functions.Constant, Models",
                          "FixedValue": 45.0,
                          "Units": "d",
                          "Name": "TimeConstant",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        }
                      ],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                }
              ],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
